# What the server's image build may see (Dockerfile): only the files it copies. Everything else stays out: the client
# (Cloudflare builds it), node_modules (installed fresh in the image), tests, env files and notes.
*
!server/package.json
!server/package-lock.json
!server/src
!server/scripts
!packages/core/package.json
!packages/core/package-lock.json
!packages/core/src
